", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"e2fb38201f2b1eafeacc0fab589bf10f58232a74cd4f0e4878e9e00baeb8185e","event_uuid":"98c8d5ee-38b4-4b4d-8e43-3e1101a76fc9","position":{"commit_sha":"1442d73c24ec0a69c240bd1d1b8124cb815e3a6d","position":"1787300405746781001-98c8d5ee-38b4-4b4d-8e43-3e1101a76fc9"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"967196097eb7ccd20a52f3ca13f8612fd1e62a5e5f9c05d486161270db01559c","event_uuid":"8ec7004f-ebb5-4464-88d3-05eb567ee159","position":{"commit_sha":"b2d38fe8cfde110c5393a99bf7f43d410e84f23e","position":"1787301671752528001-8ec7004f-ebb5-4464-88d3-05eb567ee159"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"20ebd01b9549792caa8a950e0e746e7093a97a060332ac154601a1a14f7bfc61","event_uuid":"f0e4e0f7-f95d-4281-a2bf-89ea45bb1d0d","position":{"commit_sha":"0bfd4117e42a300660461b128c34bc1ece55a1be","position":"1787301853825172001-f0e4e0f7-f95d-4281-a2bf-89ea45bb1d0d"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"},{"content_hash":"07b1881b56e4015e1a997bdf98a631908545b5598eaa55eea5204665ff7294ed","event_uuid":"d40d691e-903e-4f2a-b617-66c303583ad8","position":{"commit_sha":"52d54114f658091d676731e0b31538f2acd001ff","position":"1787301858475323001-d40d691e-903e-4f2a-b617-66c303583ad8"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"bridge_project":null,"claim_harness":null,"claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":null,"close_class":"not_a_bug","close_reason":"Does not survive independently of the reverted claim widening. Without claim accepting blocked there is no claim on a blocked -> in_progress edge, and _fold_claimed_session's docstring states the narrow keying is deliberate: 'Keyed on the open -> in_progress edge only, so a later blocked -> in_progress (etc.) leaves it untouched.' Premise removed with the parent ticket, which closed not_a_bug as intended behavior.","comments":[{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"## Premise withdrawn — recommend closing `not_a_bug`\n\nThis ticket was filed by me during the debug of `conversant-cepivorous-mastiff` on the premise\nthat `claim` had been widened to accept a `blocked` source status. **That widening was\nreverted** (operator ruling; it was creation of capability, not restoration — `blocked` is\ndesigned to be unclaimable, per `AGENTS.md:129-131`).\n\nWithout the widening there is no claim on a `blocked -> in_progress` edge, so the gap this\nticket describes does not exist. The remaining narrow keying is **documented intended\nbehaviour**, not an omission — `reducer/_processors_status.py::_fold_claimed_session`:\n\n> \"Keyed on the ``open -> in_progress`` edge only, so a later ``blocked -> in_progress`` (etc.)\n> leaves it untouched.\"\n\nIt does not survive independently of the withdrawn premise. Recommend closing `not_a_bug`.","timestamp":1787301671752528001}],"created_at":1787300390095418001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"98c8d5ee-38b4-4b4d-8e43-3e1101a76fc9","relation":"discovered_from","target_id":"0449-cf75-bb4b-41fd"}],"description":"## Discovered from\nbug `conversant-cepivorous-mastiff` (0449-cf75-bb4b-41fd), which widened `claim` to accept a `blocked` source status.\n\n## Problem\nThe session-provenance triple (`claimed_session`, `claim_harness`, `claim_remote_session`) is keyed to the `open -> in_progress` edge at three sites:\n- `_commands/txn.py::claim_core` (write side)\n- `_commands/txn.py::transition_core` (`if current_status == \"open\" and target_status == \"in_progress\"`)\n- `reducer/_processors_status.py::_fold_claimed_session` (`if data.get(\"current_status\") == \"open\" and data.get(\"status\") == \"in_progress\"`)\n\nNow that `claim` accepts `blocked`, a blocked-source claim writes `session`/`harness` into the STATUS event but the reducer does NOT fold them into reduced state, so `claimed_session` keeps whatever a previous episode left there (or stays null).\n\n## Why it was NOT fixed under the parent bug\n`_fold_claimed_session`'s docstring states the narrow keying is deliberate. Widening it changes **replay semantics for existing historical stores** — a months-old `blocked -> in_progress` transition event would begin clearing `claimed_session` on replay where it previously did not. That is too high a blast radius for a bug fix.\n\nThe same staleness already occurs today via the sanctioned `transition blocked in_progress` path, so it is pre-existing, not introduced.\n\n## Scope if taken\nDecide whether ANY `* -> in_progress` edge should refresh the provenance triple, and if so migrate all three sites together with an explicit story about historical replay.","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"f0e4e0f7-f95d-4281-a2bf-89ea45bb1d0d","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"closed","tags":[],"ticket_id":"f989-31e9-a6e1-4e26","ticket_type":"bug","title":"claimed_session provenance is not folded for a blocked-source claim","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["703bc9c0-2bd0-4ae6-afbd-6494682a5eaf","98c8d5ee-38b4-4b4d-8e43-3e1101a76fc9","8ec7004f-ebb5-4464-88d3-05eb567ee159","f0e4e0f7-f95d-4281-a2bf-89ea45bb1d0d","d40d691e-903e-4f2a-b617-66c303583ad8"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787306096366119001,"uuid":"8aa68d67-2148-4947-9640-c6cb9f65b61b"}